{"title":"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(Brute_Force)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (Brute Force)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4_(Easy,_similar_to_solution_1)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4 (Easy, similar to solution 1)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_5_(Capital_Pi)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 5 (Capital Pi)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_BoundlessBrain!\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by BoundlessBrain!</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/9/ed99be44744f6d151766ad46305f28b8bcec3cdb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3\\times 5}{9\\times 11}\\times \\frac{7\\times 9\\times 11}{3\\times 5\\times 7}=$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"179\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/8/6b89e57af080cd21088973d314df4e2e024ef24e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 1 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 0 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 49 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ \\frac{1}{49} \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"361\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By the commutative property: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/a/97aef54351f42094cdf2e967f9366028a3931e4e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{3\\times 5}{9\\times 11}\\times \\frac{7\\times 9\\times 11}{3\\times 5\\times 7}=\\frac{3\\times 5\\times 7 \\times 9 \\times 11}{9\\times 11\\times 3 \\times 5 \\times 7}= \\frac{3\\times 5 \\times 7 \\times 9 \\times 11}{3\\times 5 \\times 7 \\times 9 \\times 11}=\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}~1}\\]\" width=\"573\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Notice that the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/a/44a2037ff1b135a7cabe3d03a7fa1a11c765491d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9 \\times 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"51\" height=\"15\" /> in the denominator of the first fraction cancels with the same term in the second fraction, the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />s in the numerator and denominator of the second fraction cancel, and the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/c/83cc3f3015106f232a58f1ad3fd29d868ef9e1dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 \\times 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" /> in the numerator of the first fraction cancels with the same term in the denominator second fraction. Then everything in the expression cancels, leaving us with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/3/2f3012c9d18c4b30fdc924e1d81fdcb2ede9a425.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}~1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"57\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:Cxsmi\">cxsmi</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28Brute_Force.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(Brute_Force)\">Solution 3 (Brute Force)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (Brute Force)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>(Note: This method is highly time consuming and should only be used as a last resort in math, also please do not do this.)\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/2/6b2254da24322bc8530b51a55cbdbdbd12e70b45.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 \\times 5 \\times 7 \\times 9 \\times 11 = 10395$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"215\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/5/b2553cb66f4930234528f97412224b4c157c613c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9 \\times 11 \\times 3 \\times 5 \\times 7 = 10395$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"215\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>Thus, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/b/97b74ee8cccf0c3cfc83d191b525a0059233f3d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}\\ 1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"55\" height=\"28\" />\n</p><p>~ lovelearning999 ~<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Shunyipanda&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Shunyipanda (page does not exist)\">shunyipanda</a> (Minor edit)\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_4_.28Easy.2C_similar_to_solution_1.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4_(Easy,_similar_to_solution_1)\">Solution 4 (Easy, similar to solution 1)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4 (Easy, similar to solution 1)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Notice the two fractions are multiplied, so we can consider them as 1 fraction. All terms cancel out, leaving us with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/3/2f3012c9d18c4b30fdc924e1d81fdcb2ede9a425.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}~1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"57\" height=\"30\" />.\n~<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Shunyipanda&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Shunyipanda (page does not exist)\">shunyipanda</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_5_.28Capital_Pi.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_5_(Capital_Pi)\">Solution 5 (Capital Pi)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 5 (Capital Pi)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>This fraction can be simplified to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/6/ca6b4cfb9263656806a1456c6f884423e179d9f2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{\\prod_{k=1}^{5}(2k+1)}{\\prod_{k=1}^{5}(2k+1)}\\]\" width=\"106\" height=\"49\" /> The numerator and denominator are the same, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/b/97b74ee8cccf0c3cfc83d191b525a0059233f3d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}\\ 1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"55\" height=\"28\" />. ~<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Shunyipanda&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Shunyipanda (page does not exist)\">shunyipanda</a> Note: please can somebody make this look better\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_BoundlessBrain.21\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_BoundlessBrain!\">Video Solution by BoundlessBrain!</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by BoundlessBrain!\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/eC_Vu3vogHM\">https://youtu.be/eC_Vu3vogHM</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME\" title=\"1985 AJHSME\">1985 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1985\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First <br /> Question</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?titl